  "title": "Egyptian Lahma Bil Basal (Beef in Rich Onion Sauce)",
  "description": "Egyptian beef stew, known as lahma bil basal, is simmered with plenty of onions creating a rich and simple dinner to keep you warm on cold evenings.",
